# Architecture

This is a **Python 3.10+** LiveKit rebuild of Bush & Bush Law Group's Retell intake: Claire greets inbound SIP, routes a case type, collects must-haves, then posts analysis. Do not add frameworks, dashboards, ORMs, databases, or a test suite unless asked. Follow the existing layout.

## Stack (do not expand)

- Voice: LiveKit Agents `~=1.6`, Deepgram STT, OpenAI LLM, ElevenLabs TTS, Silero VAD
- Optional: LiveKit Cloud noise cancellation (`BVCTelephony`), cloud TurnDetector
- Control: FastAPI + Uvicorn + Pydantic v2
- HTTP: aiohttp (webhooks), python-dotenv
- Telephony: Twilio SIP → LiveKit inbound trunk → this worker

Two processes: `python -m src.worker` (calls) and `uvicorn src.api:app` (control API).

## Module map

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `src/settings.py` | All config + Retell→LiveKit conversion formulas |
| `src/prompts.py` | Verbatim Retell prompts; edit here, never paraphrase in agents |
| `src/schemas.py` | Post-call field definitions (source of truth for extract + webhook) |
| `src/models.py` | STT/LLM/TTS/VAD/turn-handling factories + shared AsyncOpenAI |
| `src/state.py` | Per-call `CallState`, NANP phone rules, `may_end_call()` |
| `src/capture.py` | Inline regex fast-path (phone, read-back, sign-off) |
| `src/extract.py` | Background live field capture (off by default) |
| `src/routing.py` | Keyword pass then LLM classify |
| `src/lifecycle.py` | Reminders, max duration, silence hangup |
| `src/postcall.py` | Analysis + disk record + `call_analyzed` webhook |
| `src/agents/` | `RouterAgent` + five `BaseIntakeAgent` specialists |
| `src/worker.py` | Call entrypoint and shutdown → postcall |
| `src/api.py` | Authenticated control API |

## Non-negotiables

- Preserve Retell parity: numeric settings live in `settings.py` with explicit conversion functions, not magic numbers in agents.
- Prompts in `prompts.py` are copied verbatim. Changing call behaviour means editing prompts/settings, not inventing a new agent stack.
- Handoff is `session.update_agent(..., chat_ctx=..., greet=False)` — never re-greet, never invent `transfer_*` tools.
- Only `end_call` (gated by `CallState.may_end_call()`), router decline via `finish_session`, and lifecycle watchdogs may hang up. Capture/extract never end a call.
- Do not pass `parallel_tool_calls` or `tool_choice` to a tool-less agent (the router). OpenAI 400s and the call goes silent after the greeting.
- One agent registry: `AGENTS_BY_CASE_TYPE` in `src/agents/router.py`. New specialists get a `source_prompt` class attribute.
- Phone digits go through `normalize_phone`. Prefer `asyncio.create_task` and `time.monotonic()` for watchdogs.
- Prefer extending existing modules over new packages. Pin new deps with `~=` in `requirements.txt`.
